0..67 Comment "/// This source states congruence for reflexivity under conversion."
68..71 Comment "///"
72..150 Comment "/// Two reflexivity terms agree when their points convert at every path level."
151..220 Comment "/// It is the HoTT book\'s § 1.12 (`refl`) under judgmental equality."
221..275 Comment "/// A parameter does not reduce to a reflexivity term."
276..279 Comment "///"
280..333 Comment "/// The checker converts endpoints by each rule form."
334..385 Comment "/// It compares each path at its resolved equality."
386..389 Comment "///"
390..437 Comment "/// Limits: conversion knows no arithmetic law."
438..441 Comment "///"
442..477 Comment "/// - see: #1723 — `peak_is_here`"
478..509 Comment "/// - see: #2378 — `held_sum`"
